{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "ride-booking-demo-workflow-cce",
    "name": "Ride Booking Platform - Interview Demo Workflow (CCE)",
    "description": "Sequential workflow collection for interview demonstration on CCE infrastructure\n\n📋 WORKFLOW SEQUENCE:\n1. Health Checks (verify all 3 services UP)\n2. Register Rider + Driver\n3. Update Driver Location (near pickup)\n4. Create Ride #1 (Happy Path - Driver Assigned)\n5. View Ride Details (status=ASSIGNED)\n6. Complete Ride #1\n7. Rate Ride\n8. Register 2nd Driver (beyond 5km)\n9. Create Ride #2 (No Driver Available scenario)\n10. View Ride #2 (status=NO_DRIVER_AVAILABLE) ← EVENT CONSUMED\n11. Create Ride #3 (for cancellation demo)\n12. Cancel Ride #3\n13. Try Cancel Again (show state machine guard)\n14. Data Inspection (All Rides, Drivers, Notifications)\n\n🌐 DOMAIN MAPPING:\n• Ride Service: rideservice-cceridebookingnischaynischay131.internal.cce.zetaapps.in\n• Driver Service: driverservice-cceridebookingnischaynischay131.internal.cce.zetaapps.in\n• Notification Service: notificationservice-cceridebookingnischaynischay131.internal.cce.zetaapps.in\n\n⚙️ TECH DETAILS:\n• Geospatial Matching: Haversine distance (5km radius)\n• Tie-Breaking: distance → rating → registration time\n• Pricing: Random ₹50–₹500 (simulated 3rd-party integration)\n• Event Bus: Atropos (Kinesis)\n• Webhooks: Auto-triggered for state changes",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
